From aa044bc210e50f7c00405375188263253dcadc81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:37:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applets/batterymonitor: let manual sleep blocking end after a
 while

Manually blocking sleep and screen locking stayed on until it was turned
off again, so it was easy to forget. Like Do Not Disturb, the switch now
asks for how long to block: 1 hour, 4 hours or until manually unblocked.

BUG: 458095
